  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conservation of Ancient Roman Imperial and Other Monuments and Sites in the Jabal Moussa Biosphere Reserve, Phase 3</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Jabal Moussa Biosphere Reserve and Adonis Valley share a common history and represent a historical chain of events that has brought together humans and nature since the Phoenicians. This project continues work begun under previous Ambassadors Fund grants and includes the documentation and preservation of Bronze Age and Ottoman period sites in the reserve.</narrative>
  </description>
